Suggested fixes
  1. The DOM settles after load [dom-stability, weight 7]
     Finish rendering before load, avoid late-inserted banners/ads, reserve space for async
     content, stop polling updates when idle.
  2. Structured data (JSON-LD) describes the page [structured-data, weight 3]
     Add JSON-LD for Organization/WebSite on the home page and Product/Offer, FAQPage,
     ContactPoint or BreadcrumbList on inner pages.
  3. Controls are native or complete ARIA widgets [native-controls, weight 7]
     Prefer native <select>, <input type="date|range|number">; when custom widgets are
     unavoidable, implement the full ARIA pattern (roles, states such as
     aria-valuenow/aria-expanded, keyboard support).
  4. llms.txt is published and well-formed [llms-txt, weight 3]
     Publish /llms.txt with an H1, a one-paragraph blockquote and H2 sections of markdown links
     to the most useful pages.

